  Message:
    `monthly_rent` is a field of `Tenant` only.
    But `a` could also be `Landlord`, which has no `monthly_rent`.

    Nothing here narrows `a`: it is used at the whole type `Actor`,
    so every constructor of `Actor` can reach this read.

    Narrow `a` first:

      EVERY Tenant a …
      CONSIDER a WHEN Tenant t THEN … a's monthly_rent …

    (or just `THEN t` when the field is the whole payload), or put the read
    under an `OTHERWISE` after the other arms — or declare `monthly_rent` on
    `Landlord` too.

